    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8747;</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>5</mn></msup><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><msup><mi>e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi></math>,&nbsp;where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>c</mi></math> is a constant of integration, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is equal to",
